# --- Local runtime state ------------------------------------------------------
# Content-addressed blobs written by the local FileStore, the throwaway vaults
# the test suite creates, and the PostgreSQL cluster `pgserver` initialises for
# tests. All reproducible; none of it is source.
backend/var/

